"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"PGd06nrseC2YAIqP6S9gUA","review_id":"H4Kiu9vdr2ElvIzRJWPOaw","date":"2018-11-17T17:28:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9364465475082397,"text_excerpt":"For our last meal in NOLA, I'm so glad it was Ruby Slipper. Definitely don't be swayed by all of the tourists and long wait times. You can put your name on the waitlist through Yelp (amazing) and wait in the comfort of your own hangover. Granted, because they were PACKED on a Sunday morning, food did take quite a bit of time to come out. BUT WORTH IT- I had the candied bacon and biscuit AND peacemaker with Cochon and St. Charles benedicts. While both the benedicts were absolutely delicious- the biscuits and crack bacon really were just amazing. The biscuit was dense, fluffy, perfectly flavorful (the honey butter didn't hurt). The bacon was candied but still maintained its savoriness which..."},{"business_id":"PGd06nrseC2YAIqP6S9gUA","review_id":"Sbu49pOPhyR-9mON0gkwsA","date":"2015-03-02T16:39:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9359625577926636,"text_excerpt":"Yum. Great spot for breakfast/brunch. Came on a Sunday morning and had about a 20 minute wait. Sent my husband inside to get us Bloody Mary's from the tiny bar right next to the hostess stand (for the poor souls waiting to get in), drinks were very good. Once we were seated, our server was very helpful and friendly. I had the eggs cochon, wow, it was delicious. My husband had a special of the day, meatloaf benediction, also good. I'd definitely come back."},{"business_id":"PGd06nrseC2YAIqP6S9gUA","review_id":"B_z5a-t-FDeO2Y9dVmTzUA","date":"2017-06-27T15:36:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9349203109741211,"text_excerpt":"I really enjoyed this place! There was quite the wait for lunch, but they have this fantastic feature through Yelp where you can get on the waiting list before even showing up. It even tells you their current wait time. Once we arrived, we had some more time to wait and honestly it did seem to take longer than quoted, but no big deal! It was a beautiful day and there was a friendly host taking drink orders and then bringing them outside to us while we waited! We ordered mimosas while we waited. When they arrived I took a sip and was happily surprised at how strong it was. Usually restaurants makes a mimosa mostly OJ with a splash of champagne. Not here! It was damn-near the opposite! Love..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"PGd06nrseC2YAIqP6S9gUA","photo_id":"ZMlzOz1ON0MDsHVZ_5IfBg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/ZMlzOz1ON0MDsHVZ_5IfBg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9032541513442993},{"business_id":"PGd06nrseC2YAIqP6S9gUA","photo_id":"wJGFNY28VoWOYvD0dPbZiQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/wJGFNY28VoWOYvD0dPbZiQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8472756147384644},{"business_id":"PGd06nrseC2YAIqP6S9gUA","photo_id":"AayEnJgTc-69f5I1k-buag","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/AayEnJgTc-69f5I1k-buag.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8263925313949585},{"business_id":"PGd06nrseC2YAIqP6S9gUA","photo_id":"hBV_U15R0d0HDX-D7DcWRQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/hBV_U15R0d0HDX-D7DcWRQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7948175668716431},{"business_id":"PGd06nrseC2YAIqP6S9gUA","photo_id":"WeGJXK8r6I07sVN_UY_7-w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WeGJXK8r6I07sVN_UY_7-w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7608051300048828}]},"notebook_case":null}
